* text=auto eol=lf
patches/*.patch text eol=lf whitespace=-space-before-tab
# Collected company-skill payloads pack into dsh-company-skills/assets/skills.bundle
# byte-for-byte, and `verify:bundle` re-packs the tree expecting identical bytes
# (the Deloitte PPTD template ships CRLF .pptd/.page files verbatim), so git
# must never renormalize anything under that tree.
dsh-company-skills/skills/** -text
